{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/124-ge-sheng/fangyurun-yuanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/124-ge-sheng/fangyurun-yuanshi/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 葛生 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 唐風 · 葛生 · 汇集《诗经原始(上下)》关于《葛生》的 4 条注释，含 4 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"124-ge-sheng","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/124-ge-sheng/fangyurun-yuanshi","poem":{"id":"124-ge-sheng","title":"葛生","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"tangfeng","path":["風","唐風","葛生"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"葛生蒙楚","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"蘝蔓于野","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"予美亡此","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"誰與獨處","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"葛生蒙棘","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"蘝蔓于域","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"予美亡此","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"誰與獨息","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"角枕粲兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"錦衾爛兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"予美亡此","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"誰與獨旦","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-013","text":"夏之日","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-014","text":"冬之夜","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-015","text":"百歲之後","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-016","text":"歸于其居","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-017","text":"冬之夜","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-018","text":"夏之日","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-019","text":"百歲之後","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-020","text":"歸于其室","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":4,"glossCount":4},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"征婦怨也。","targetNotes":"篇首题注。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 篇首题注。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"右《葛生》五章，章四句。《序》以爲「刺晉獻公好攻戰，則國人多喪」。朱子謂「未見此詩之果作於其時」，然亦安知此詩之非必不出其時耶？然此等處無關詩旨緊要，可置而弗辯，但以爲征婦怨可也。征婦思夫久役于外，或存或亡，均不可知，其歸與否，更不能必。於是日夜悲思，冬夏難已。暇則展其衾枕，物猶粲爛，人是孤棲，不禁傷心，發爲浩歎。以爲此生無復見理，惟有百歲後返其遺骸，或與吾同歸一穴而已，他何望耶？唐人詩云：「可憐無定河邊骨，猶是深閨夢裏人。」可以想見此詩景況。説《詩》諸老不察其情，或以爲思存，或以爲悼亡，已極可歎。又或謂枕衾粲爛，其嫁未久，更覺腐論難堪。三百篇多少好詩，純被此種迂儒説壞。能不令人扼腕！眉評〔四、五章〕二章句法只一互换，覺時光流轉，眴息百年，人生幾何，能不傷心！","targetNotes":"总评与眉评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 总评与眉评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"蘝〔《集傳》〕蘝，草名，似栝樓，葉盛而細。蔓延也。予美婦人指其夫也。域塋域也。","targetNotes":"集释原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集釋"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"楚六語。野二十一馬，叶上與反。處六語。叶韻。棘十三職。域、息並同。本韻。粲十五翰。爛、旦並同。本韻。夜二十二禡，叶羊茹反。居六魚。叶韻。日四質。室同。本韻。","targetNotes":"标韵原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标韵段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"標韻"}]}]}}}
